{"seq":2,"slug":"distributions","title":"分布 (Block/Cyclic)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/chapel-parallel-programming/distribution/distributions","wordCount":1798,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"分布-block-cyclic\">分布 (Block/Cyclic)</h1><p>到目前为止，<a href=\"domains-arrays\">域与数组</a>里声明的数组默认都住在 Locale 0 上——它们是「本地」的，再大的 <code>forall</code> 也只用到一个节点的内存和核心。要让一个数组真正铺到上百个节点，你需要给它的域贴一张<strong>分布（distribution，也叫 domain map／域映射）</strong>。这一篇讲清分布是什么、Block 与 Cyclic 等内置分布如何切分数据、各自适合什么负载，以及为什么换一种分布只需改一行代码。这是 Chapel 从「并行库」跃升为「分布式语言」的那一步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>分布（distribution，也叫域映射）是贴在域上的一张「下标→拥有者 locale」的映射函数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>owner</mtext><mo>:</mo><mtext>Index</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>Locale</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>owner</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{owner}: \\text{Index} \\rightarrow \\text{Locale}, \\qquad \\text{owner}(i) \\in \\{L_0, L_1, \\dots, L_{p-1}\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">owner</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Index</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Locale</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">owner</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><strong>理解一个分布 = 理解它的 <code>owner(i)</code> 函数</strong>：Block 是整除（连续大块，局部性好、怕负载不均），Cyclic 是取模（逐元素轮转，负载均衡好但局部性差），BlockCyclic 用块大小在二者间调，Stencil 在 Block 基础上缓存邻居「光环」。</li>\n<li><strong>一贴就跨节点</strong>：给域贴上分布，依附该域的数组自动切到各 locale，而算法代码（<code>forall</code>、<code>+ reduce</code>、数组运算）<strong>一字不改</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>分布与算法正交</strong>：换分布只改声明里一个词，可把它当超参数搜索，而非一旦定下就难以撼动的架构决策。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>算法写一次、换分布只换声明里那一处，正是它相比 MPI／coarray 的开发效率代差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"域映射-给域贴一张-数据放哪-的图\">域映射：给域贴一张「数据放哪」的图</h2><p>分布的形式很简单——在声明域时加一个 <code>dmapped</code>（或新语法里直接用分布类型构造域）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"chapel\" data-code=\"use BlockDist;&#10;const Space = {1..n};&#10;const D = Space dmapped Block(boundingBox=Space);  // 给 D 贴上 Block 分布&#10;var A: [D] real;                                    // A 自动切到所有 locale\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use BlockDist;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const Space = {1..n};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const D = Space dmapped Block(boundingBox=Space);  // 给 D 贴上 Block 分布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>var A: [D] real;                                    // A 自动切到所有 locale</span></span></code></pre></div><p>就这一行，<code>A</code> 从「全住在 Locale 0」变成「按 Block 规则切到所有 <code>Locales</code>」。而你后面所有针对 <code>A</code> 的代码——<code>forall a in A</code>、<code>+ reduce A</code>、<code>A = B + C</code>——<strong>一个字都不用改</strong>，它们会自动变成跨节点并行。这就是域映射的承诺：把「数据如何分布」从「算法如何表达」中彻底解耦。算法写一次，换分布只换声明里那一处。</p>\n<p>域映射在概念上是一个函数：它把每个全局下标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 映射到一个「拥有者 locale」。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>owner</mtext><mo>:</mo><mtext>Index</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>Locale</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>owner</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{owner}: \\text{Index} \\rightarrow \\text{Locale}, \\qquad \\text{owner}(i) \\in \\{L_0, L_1, \\dots, L_{p-1}\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">owner</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Index</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Locale</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">owner</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>不同的分布，就是不同的 <code>owner</code> 函数。理解一个分布，就是理解它的 <code>owner</code> 长什么样。</p>\n<h2 id=\"block-把连续块切给各-locale\">Block：把连续块切给各 locale</h2><p><strong>Block 分布</strong>把下标空间切成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 个<strong>连续的大块</strong>，每个 locale 拿一块。对 <code>{1..1000}</code> 分到 4 个 locale，大致是：Locale 0 拿 1..250、Locale 1 拿 251..500、依此类推。它的 <code>owner</code> 函数是「下标除以块大小」：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>owner</mtext><mtext>Block</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mtext>lo</mtext></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{owner}_{\\text{Block}}(i) = \\left\\lfloor \\frac{i - \\text{lo}}{\\lceil N/p \\rceil} \\right\\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">owner</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Block</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lo</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Block 的优势是<strong>局部性好</strong>：相邻下标大概率在同一 locale，于是 stencil（如 <code>A[i] = A[i-1] + A[i+1]</code>）这类「访问邻居」的计算，绝大多数访问落在本地，只有块边界处需要少量跨节点通信。这让它成为科学计算（偏微分方程、图像处理、矩阵运算）的默认选择。它的弱点是若各下标的计算量不均（负载不均衡），某些 locale 会比别的忙。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cyclic-轮转分发以求均衡\">Cyclic：轮转分发以求均衡</h2><p><strong>Cyclic 分布</strong>反过来：它把下标<strong>轮流</strong>发给各 locale，像发牌——下标 1 给 Locale 0、2 给 Locale 1、3 给 Locale 2、4 给 Locale 3、5 又回到 Locale 0。<code>owner</code> 函数是取模：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>owner</mtext><mtext>Cyclic</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mtext>lo</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{owner}_{\\text{Cyclic}}(i) = (i - \\text{lo}) \\bmod p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">owner</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Cyclic</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lo</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Cyclic 的优势是<strong>负载均衡</strong>：当不同下标的计算量差异大（比如三角矩阵、自适应算法），轮转分发能把忙的和闲的下标摊匀到每个 locale。它的代价是<strong>局部性差</strong>：相邻下标几乎一定在不同 locale，stencil 计算每访问一个邻居就跨一次节点，通信爆炸。</p>\n<p><strong>BlockCyclic</strong> 是两者的折中——把下标切成固定大小的小块，再把这些小块轮转分发，用块大小这个旋钮在「局部性」和「均衡」之间调。</p>\n<p>下表把三者放在一起对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分布</th>\n<th>切分方式</th>\n<th>局部性</th>\n<th>负载均衡</th>\n<th>适合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Block</code></td>\n<td>连续大块，每 locale 一块</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>一般（怕不均匀）</td>\n<td>stencil、矩阵、规则网格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Cyclic</code></td>\n<td>逐元素轮转分发</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>计算量随下标剧烈变化的负载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>BlockCyclic</code></td>\n<td>小块轮转分发</td>\n<td>可调</td>\n<td>可调</td>\n<td>块状算法（如分块矩阵乘）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Stencil</code></td>\n<td>类 Block + 缓存邻居「光环」</td>\n<td>极好（邻居本地缓存）</td>\n<td>一般</td>\n<td>反复访问固定邻居的迭代 stencil</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  S[&quot;下标空间 1..8, 分到 2 个 locale&quot;] --&gt; B{选哪种分布}&#10;  B --&gt;|Block| BL[&quot;L0: 1,2,3,4&lt;br/&gt;L1: 5,6,7,8&lt;br/&gt;邻居多在本地&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|Cyclic| CY[&quot;L0: 1,3,5,7&lt;br/&gt;L1: 2,4,6,8&lt;br/&gt;负载摊匀&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|Stencil| ST[&quot;类 Block + 各 locale&lt;br/&gt;缓存边界邻居副本&quot;]\">graph TD\n  S[\"下标空间 1..8, 分到 2 个 locale\"] --&gt; B{选哪种分布}\n  B --&gt;|Block| BL[\"L0: 1,2,3,4&lt;br/&gt;L1: 5,6,7,8&lt;br/&gt;邻居多在本地\"]\n  B --&gt;|Cyclic| CY[\"L0: 1,3,5,7&lt;br/&gt;L1: 2,4,6,8&lt;br/&gt;负载摊匀\"]\n  B --&gt;|Stencil| ST[\"类 Block + 各 locale&lt;br/&gt;缓存边界邻居副本\"]</pre><h2 id=\"stencil-分布-为-访问邻居-量身定做\">Stencil 分布：为「访问邻居」量身定做</h2><p>科学计算里最常见的模式是迭代 stencil——每个网格点反复用它上下左右邻居的值更新自己（热传导、流体、卷积都是）。Block 分布下，块边界的点每轮都要去隔壁 locale 取邻居值，重复通信。<strong>Stencil 分布</strong>专门优化这点：它在 Block 的基础上，让每个 locale 额外缓存一圈邻居 locale 的边界数据（叫「光环／halo」或 fluff），每轮迭代前用一次 <code>updateFluff()</code> 批量刷新这圈缓存，之后整轮计算全是本地访问。</p>\n<p>这把「每个边界点一次细粒度远程读」变成了「每轮一次粗粒度批量同步」，通信次数从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>边界点数</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\text{边界点数})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">边界点数</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 每轮。Stencil 是 Block 的「stencil 特化版」，体现了 Chapel 域映射框架的可扩展性——分布是可插拔的策略，社区和用户都能写新的。具体的通信压制原理，<a href=\"locality-control\">局部性控制</a>会从 <code>local</code> 块与聚合的角度再讲一遍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"换分布只改一行-解耦的红利\">换分布只改一行：解耦的红利</h2><p>域映射设计最实际的红利，是<strong>实验成本极低</strong>。同一个算法，你想知道 Block 还是 Cyclic 更快，只需改声明里的一个词：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"chapel\" data-code=\"const D = Space dmapped Block(boundingBox=Space);   // 试 Block&#10;// const D = Space dmapped Cyclic(startIdx=Space.low);  // 换成 Cyclic, 算法零改动\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const D = Space dmapped Block(boundingBox=Space);   // 试 Block</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// const D = Space dmapped Cyclic(startIdx=Space.low);  // 换成 Cyclic, 算法零改动</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 MPI 世界里，这种切换意味着重写所有数据切分和通信逻辑——可能是几天的工作；在 Chapel 里是改一行、重新跑。这种「分布与算法正交」的解耦，让你能把分布当成一个可调超参数去搜索最优，而不是一个一旦定下就难以撼动的架构决策。它也是 Chapel 相比 <a href=\"../../fortran-scientific/practice/parallel-coarrays-openmp\">Fortran coarray 手工分块</a>在开发效率上的代差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>分布（域映射）是贴在域上的一张「下标→拥有者 locale」的映射函数</strong>；贴上它，依附该域的数组自动切到各 locale，而算法代码一字不改。</li>\n<li><strong>Block</strong> 切连续大块，局部性好、适合 stencil 与矩阵，怕负载不均；<strong>Cyclic</strong> 逐元素轮转，负载均衡好但局部性差；<strong>BlockCyclic</strong> 用块大小在二者间调。</li>\n<li><strong>Stencil 分布</strong>在 Block 基础上缓存邻居「光环」，把每轮的细粒度远程读批量成一次 <code>updateFluff()</code>，专为迭代 stencil 优化。</li>\n<li>理解一个分布 = 理解它的 <code>owner(i)</code> 函数：Block 是整除，Cyclic 是取模。</li>\n<li>域映射让「分布」与「算法」正交：换分布只改一行声明，可把它当超参数搜索，是相比 MPI/coarray 的开发效率代差。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：分布数组上怎么压住通信、保证计算贴着数据跑，看<a href=\"locality-control\">局部性控制</a>；分布的载体「域」本身见<a href=\"domains-arrays\">域与数组</a>；分布数组上的归约为何高效回看<a href=\"../parallelism/reductions-scans\">归约与扫描</a>。横向对照其它语言的分布式数组见 <a href=\"../../julia-scientific/applications/parallel-distributed\">Julia：并行与分布式</a>。</p>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://chapel-lang.org/docs/\">Chapel Documentation 2.8 — Standard Distributions</a>、<a href=\"https://davidbader.net/post/20260121-chapel/\">Exploiting Chapel&#39;s Distributed Arrays for Graph Analysis (David Bader, 2026)</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分布 (Block/Cyclic)","id":"分布-block-cyclic"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"域映射：给域贴一张「数据放哪」的图","id":"域映射-给域贴一张-数据放哪-的图"},{"level":2,"text":"Block：把连续块切给各 locale","id":"block-把连续块切给各-locale"},{"level":2,"text":"Cyclic：轮转分发以求均衡","id":"cyclic-轮转分发以求均衡"},{"level":2,"text":"Stencil 分布：为「访问邻居」量身定做","id":"stencil-分布-为-访问邻居-量身定做"},{"level":2,"text":"换分布只改一行：解耦的红利","id":"换分布只改一行-解耦的红利"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"域与数组","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/chapel-parallel-programming/distribution/domains-arrays"},"next":{"title":"局部性控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/chapel-parallel-programming/distribution/locality-control"}}